    "detailed_description": "Do you like hidden objects games? Then go on a journey and immerse yourself in the culture and traditions of different countries!<br />\r\nYou'll visit over 150 cities in 7 countries, find over 10,000 hidden objects, and discover amazing facts about world-famous landmarks and historical places.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy wonderful themed music that will make you feel the atmosphere of each country better.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHours of fun and relaxation for the whole family are guaranteed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe are constantly working on new updates and soon many more great locations from different countries will appear in the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTrain your brain, compete with other players from all over the world and win! Download the Hidden Object Vacation puzzle game right now!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is only a hidden object game, nothing else! No story lines nothing else for you to do but find objects!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEarn all possible stars in 3 game modes in each location - word find, silhouette and scrambled letters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTwo game modes - relaxed and timed will let you challenge your brain even more!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRemember - hidden objects can be everywhere!",
